    "detailed_description": "Dungeon Riddle is 3D arcade game with puzzles and mysteries in walk simulator genre.<br />\r\nIn this game, you find yourself in a dungeon where you need to look for keys and potions to move on.<br />\r\nBut there is one problem here - traps. They can be anywhere, and if you step on one of them, you'll have to start over.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA dilapidated basement and piles of traps and locked doors. A great combination.<br />\r\nAnd who used to live here? A psychopathic magician with an adventurer's mania? An alchemist with a penchant for deadly traps? Or just someone who wanted to protect his treasure at all costs?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBe careful! Don't stumble over the bodies of those who were here before you!<br />\r\nThere are many rooms in the dungeon, and each of them can be dangerous.<br />\r\nIn one room there may be a key that opens the door to the next room, and in another there may be a solvent potion in order to clear the passage further.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGood luck to you, and don't fall into the pit!",
